WEBVTT

00:00.850 --> 00:03.850
<i>[cheery music]</i>
<i>[欢快的音乐]</i>

00:03.919 --> 00:10.988
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

00:12.264 --> 00:14.747
[bell dinging]
- Okay, okay, order up.
[铃声]
=> - 好吧，好吧，订购。

00:14.815 --> 00:18.229
[dinging continues]
[叮叮声继续]

00:18.298 --> 00:19.953
[exhaust whooshes]
[排气管嘶嘶声]

00:20.022 --> 00:23.022
[dinging]
- Uh, hello, Krusty Kitchen.
[叮叮]
- 呃，你好，库斯蒂厨房。

00:23.091 --> 00:24.436
Hmm?
唔？

00:24.505 --> 00:26.126
Hello?
你好？

00:26.195 --> 00:29.160
It sounds like sleigh bells!
听起来像雪橇铃！

00:29.229 --> 00:31.022
Is that you, Santa Claus?
是你吗，圣诞老人？

00:31.091 --> 00:32.367
[grunts]
[咕哝]

00:32.436 --> 00:35.264
I can still hear the ring... go.
我仍然能听到铃声……走吧。

00:35.333 --> 00:38.402
Hm?
[strained grunt]
嗯？
[紧张的咕噜声]

00:38.471 --> 00:41.091
[ringing continues]
[铃声继续]

00:41.160 --> 00:44.333
Hmm.
No bells in here.
唔。
这里没有门铃。

00:44.402 --> 00:46.712
Egh, this is serious.
呃，这件事很严重。

00:46.781 --> 00:49.540
[whistling] And just where
do you think you're going
[口哨] 就在哪里
你觉得你要去吗

00:49.609 --> 00:51.022
during business hours?
营业时间内？

00:51.091 --> 00:53.815
Sorry, Mr. Krabs,
but I gotta see an ear doctor.
对不起，蟹老板，
但我得去看耳科医生。

00:53.884 --> 00:56.333
I've been hearing
a ringing in my ears all week.
我一直听到
整个星期我的耳朵都嗡嗡作响。

00:56.402 --> 01:00.229
Hold your sea horses, boy-o.
You don't have tinniterus.
抓住你的海马，小伙子。
你没有耳鸣。

01:00.298 --> 01:01.988
- I don't?
- No.
- 我不知道？
- 不。

01:02.057 --> 01:04.747
I've been ringing this bell
all week.
我已经敲响了这个钟
整个星期。

01:04.815 --> 01:07.091
I'm doing it
to condition the customers.
我正在做
来调节顾客。

01:07.160 --> 01:09.402
Whenever they hear the bell...
[bell rings]
每当他们听到铃声时...
[铃声响起]

01:09.471 --> 01:10.953
They'll hunger
for a Krabby Patty
他们会挨饿
蟹肉饼

01:11.022 --> 01:13.264
and come straight
to the Krusty Krab.
直来
到蟹堡王。

01:13.333 --> 01:15.574
Oh!
哦！

01:15.643 --> 01:17.712
I don't get it.
- Observe.
我不明白。
- 观察。

01:17.781 --> 01:20.574
First, I condition them
while they're eating.
首先，我调节它们
当他们吃饭的时候。

01:20.643 --> 01:23.781
[bell ringing]
[铃声响起]

01:23.850 --> 01:26.609
Beat it, Quasimodo.
打败它，卡西莫多。

01:26.678 --> 01:28.643
[chuckling]
Eh? Eh?
[轻笑]
呃？呃？

01:28.712 --> 01:32.747
Eh? Eh, eh?
[giggling]
呃？呃，呃？
[咯咯笑]

01:32.815 --> 01:35.091
I'm gonna go bop that guy!
我要去打败那个家伙！

01:35.160 --> 01:37.574
Now, now, honey.
Think of the children.
现在，现在，亲爱的。
想想孩子们。

01:37.643 --> 01:39.436
Oh, you're right, dear.
哦，你是对的，亲爱的。

01:39.505 --> 01:41.160
What was I thinking?
我在想什么？

01:41.229 --> 01:42.781
Kids, go bop that guy.
孩子们，去打败那个家伙吧。

01:42.850 --> 01:44.402
- - Eh?
- Wha...
- - 呃？
- 世界卫生大会...

01:44.471 --> 01:45.988
[yelps]
kids: [scream, grunt]
[尖叫声]
孩子们：[尖叫，咕噜声]

01:46.057 --> 01:48.229
Mmm.
[burps]
嗯。
[打嗝]

01:48.298 --> 01:49.574
[sighs]
[叹气]

01:49.643 --> 01:51.609
Now this guy's
heard the bell before.
现在这个家伙的
之前听到铃声。

01:51.678 --> 01:54.091
Watch him when I ring it.
[bell rings]
当我按铃时看着他。
[铃声响起]

01:54.160 --> 01:56.195
Mmm-hmm-hmmm.
嗯嗯嗯。

01:56.264 --> 01:59.195
<i>[sinister music]</i>
<i>[险恶的音乐]</i>

01:59.264 --> 02:00.436
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

02:00.505 --> 02:02.850
I want another Krabby Patty.
我想要另一个蟹肉饼。

02:02.919 --> 02:06.574
[gargles]
And a bucket for my saliva.
[漱口]
还有一个装我口水的桶。

02:06.643 --> 02:08.540
Oh, can I ring the little bell?
哦，我可以按响小铃吗？

02:08.609 --> 02:10.574
Can I, can I, can I?
我可以吗我可以吗我可以吗？

02:10.643 --> 02:13.471
Ohh, you can do better
than that, boy-o.
哦，你可以做得更好
比那，男孩哦。

02:13.540 --> 02:17.126
You can ring the big bell.
你可以按响大铃。

02:18.643 --> 02:21.850
Ooh!
[strained grunting]
哦！
[紧张的咕哝声]

02:23.298 --> 02:24.988
Eh...
呃……

02:25.057 --> 02:27.264
Whoa! Huh?
[bell dinging]
哇！啊？
[铃声]

02:27.333 --> 02:28.747
[clams chirping]
[蛤蜊鸣叫]

02:28.815 --> 02:31.643
<i>[foreboding music]</i>
<i>[不祥的音乐]</i>

02:31.712 --> 02:34.643
[whistling]
[吹口哨]

02:34.712 --> 02:38.229
Krabby Patty...
克拉比帕蒂...

02:38.298 --> 02:40.747
[all yelp]
[大家尖叫]

02:45.436 --> 02:47.643
[bell dinging]
[铃声]

02:47.712 --> 02:49.436
[all gargling]
[全部漱口]

02:49.505 --> 02:53.574
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

02:53.643 --> 02:56.574
[ringing continues]
[铃声继续]

02:56.643 --> 02:59.298
[all gargling]
[全部漱口]

02:59.367 --> 03:01.057
Huh?
啊？

03:02.609 --> 03:04.195
[gargling]
Krabby Patties...
[漱口]
蟹黄饼...

03:04.264 --> 03:07.195
all: Krabby Patties.
Krabby Patties.
全部：蟹肉饼。
蟹肉饼。

03:07.264 --> 03:11.264
<i>["What Shall We do with
a Drunken Sailor" plays]</i>
<i>[“我们该怎么办
喝醉的水手》播放]</i>

03:11.333 --> 03:13.126
[register dings]
[登记叮叮声]

03:13.195 --> 03:14.712
[bell dings]
[铃声]

03:14.781 --> 03:17.160
[screams]
[尖叫声]

03:17.229 --> 03:19.333
[whining]
[抱怨]

03:19.402 --> 03:22.850
No, no, no, no, no, no, no!
不，不，不，不，不，不，不！

03:22.919 --> 03:24.988
No!
No!
不！
不！

03:25.057 --> 03:27.436
[screams]
[bell rattles]
[尖叫声]
[铃声响起]

03:27.505 --> 03:30.091
[all clamoring]
- No, no, no, no, no, no, no!
[全都吵闹]
- 不，不，不，不，不，不，不！

03:30.160 --> 03:33.091
What the halibut
is wrong with you, boy?
什么是大比目鱼
小伙子，你有什么问题吗？

03:33.160 --> 03:34.747
[grunts]
[咕哝]

03:34.815 --> 03:38.298
No, no, no, no, no, no, no!
不，不，不，不，不，不，不！

03:38.367 --> 03:40.333
He's lost his mind.
他失去了理智。

03:40.402 --> 03:41.850
He never had a mind.
他从来没有头脑。

03:41.919 --> 03:43.781
Oh, I've seen this before.
哦，我以前见过这个。

03:43.850 --> 03:46.264
I know what to do.
Yah!
我知道该怎么做。
啊！

03:46.333 --> 03:49.091
No, no, no, no!
不，不，不，不！

03:49.160 --> 03:51.884
No, no, no, no!
不，不，不，不！

03:51.953 --> 03:54.505
No, no!
No, no, no...
不，不！
不，不，不……

03:54.574 --> 03:55.884
[exhales]
[呼气]

03:55.953 --> 03:57.540
When Patrick has
a tantrum like this,
当帕特里克有
像这样发脾气，

03:57.609 --> 03:59.126
jellyfish jelly on the belly
肚子上的水母果冻

03:59.195 --> 04:02.609
is the only thing
that calms him down.
是唯一的事情
这让他平静下来。

04:02.678 --> 04:05.988
Then when he comes out of it,
he hardly remembers a thing.
然后当他从其中走出来的时候，
他几乎什么都不记得了。

04:06.057 --> 04:08.643
Hey, buddy.
Feel better?
嘿，伙计。
感觉好些了吗？

04:08.712 --> 04:10.747
What's the last thing
you remember?
最后一件事是什么
你还记得吗？

04:10.815 --> 04:12.884
Uh, I remember
呃，我记得

04:12.953 --> 04:15.815
hearing a bell ring.
听到铃声响起。

04:15.884 --> 04:18.298
<i>When I was a little sea star,</i>
<i>当我还是一只小海星时，</i>

04:18.367 --> 04:21.091
<i>and... and it was time
for my bath,</i>
<i>而且...是时候了
为了我的洗澡，</i>

04:21.160 --> 04:24.436
<i>My parents would always
ring a bell.</i>
<i>我的父母总是会
响铃。</i>

04:24.505 --> 04:26.436
It's bath time, son.
儿子，洗澡时间到了。

04:26.505 --> 04:28.022
<i>I... I didn't want a bath.</i>
<i>我...我不想洗澡。</i>

04:28.091 --> 04:32.091
No, no, no, no, no, no, no!
不，不，不，不，不，不，不！

04:32.160 --> 04:36.126
No, no, no!
No, no, no, no, no!
不，不，不！
不，不，不，不，不！

04:36.195 --> 04:40.022
After that, the only thing
I remember is nothin'.
之后，唯一的事情就是
我记得没什么。

04:40.091 --> 04:42.643
Then it's time for me
to be proactive
那么我的时间到了
积极主动

04:42.712 --> 04:44.436
and help my buddy here.
并在这里帮助我的朋友。

04:44.505 --> 04:46.160
I am going to silence
我要沉默

04:46.229 --> 04:49.505
every ding-dong bell in town,
starting with...
城里的每一声叮咚钟声，
开始于...

04:49.574 --> 04:51.643
[grunts]
This one.
[咕哝]
这个。

04:51.712 --> 04:53.471
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

04:53.540 --> 04:56.436
And this one!
还有这个！

04:56.505 --> 04:59.333
Wait, how'd you get
so strong all of a sudden?
等等，你怎么得到的
突然这么强？

04:59.402 --> 05:02.229
Through the power of friendship!
通过友谊的力量！

05:02.298 --> 05:03.815
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

05:03.884 --> 05:05.953
Look out,
bells of Bikini Bottom.
当心，
比基尼泳裤的铃铛。

05:06.022 --> 05:08.850
SpongeBob is about to silence
every ring,
海绵宝宝即将沉默
每一个戒指，

05:08.919 --> 05:12.195
chime, buzz, and jingle jangle.
钟声、嗡嗡声和叮当声。

05:12.264 --> 05:15.505
Hyah-ha! <i>[heroic music]</i>
哈哈！ <i>[英雄音乐]</i>

05:15.574 --> 05:19.229
There goes a dear darling dude.
一个亲爱的家伙走了。

05:19.298 --> 05:22.953
There goes
my brilliant bell business.
那里去了
我辉煌的钟生意。

05:23.022 --> 05:24.298
You know, Pat-O,
你知道，帕特奥，

05:24.367 --> 05:26.471
I was studying
your impressive moves
我正在学习
你令人印象深刻的举动

05:26.540 --> 05:29.643
during your little,
um, acrimony.
在你小的时候，
嗯，尖酸刻薄。

05:29.712 --> 05:32.505
My little macaroni?
我的小通心粉？

05:32.574 --> 05:35.160
Yeah, that's right,
and I believe that I have a way
是的，没错，
我相信我有办法

05:35.229 --> 05:38.091
to make back all the money
I'm gonna lose.
赚回所有的钱
我会输的。

05:38.160 --> 05:40.195
One million dollars
to the challenger
一百万美元
致挑战者

05:40.264 --> 05:44.402
that can beat Harry the Health
Hazard in supreme fighting.
可以打败健康哈利
最高战斗中的危险。

05:44.471 --> 05:47.091
[laughs]
[笑]

05:47.160 --> 05:49.884
<i>[radical rock music]</i>
<i>[激进摇滚音乐]</i>

05:49.953 --> 05:52.815
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

05:52.884 --> 05:54.850
Not the pretzel!
[whimpers]
不是椒盐卷饼！
[呜咽]

05:54.919 --> 05:57.298
Hoo-yah!
呼呀！

05:57.367 --> 05:59.643
[hums]
[哼哼]

05:59.712 --> 06:01.540
[chomps]
[咀嚼]

06:01.609 --> 06:04.091
- [squeals]
- [growls]
- [尖叫声]
- [咆哮]

06:05.850 --> 06:09.091
That reminds me.
I'm still hungry.
这让我想起了。
我还饿着呢。

06:09.160 --> 06:11.091
Got any more posters?
还有更多海报吗？

06:11.160 --> 06:12.609
Knock yourself out.
把自己打垮。

06:12.678 --> 06:14.953
We're gonna be
rolling in posters.
我们将会是
海报中滚动。

06:15.022 --> 06:18.229
[chuckles]
[chomping]
[笑声]
[咀嚼]

06:20.367 --> 06:22.505
[bell ringing]
[铃声响起]

06:22.574 --> 06:24.712
Huh?
啊？

06:24.781 --> 06:26.540
<i>[heroic music]</i>
<i>[英雄音乐]</i>

06:26.609 --> 06:28.022
[grunts]
[咕哝]

06:28.091 --> 06:29.953
For my buddy, Patrick!
为了我的朋友帕特里克！

06:30.022 --> 06:32.850
[grunts, squeals]
[咕哝声、尖叫声]

06:32.919 --> 06:34.781
[crowd screaming]
[人群尖叫]

06:34.850 --> 06:37.126
[bike bell ringing]
[自行车铃声响起]

06:37.195 --> 06:38.919
[panting]
- Hmm?
[气喘吁吁]
- 嗯？

06:38.988 --> 06:40.850
[grunts]
[咕哝]

06:40.919 --> 06:43.850
<i>[monkey screeches]</i>
<i>[猴子尖叫声]</i>

06:43.919 --> 06:46.678
For my buddy, Patrick!
为了我的朋友帕特里克！

06:46.747 --> 06:48.471
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

06:50.298 --> 06:54.022
<i>[cow moos]
For my buddy, Patrick!</i>
<i>[牛哞哞]
为了我的朋友帕特里克！</i>

06:54.091 --> 06:56.609
[worms barking]
[蠕虫吠叫]

06:56.678 --> 06:59.609
[bell ringing]
[铃声响起]

06:59.678 --> 07:05.574
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

07:05.643 --> 07:08.195
[gurgling]
For Patrick!
[咕噜声]
为了帕特里克！

07:09.160 --> 07:11.333
[boat horn honks]
[船喇叭鸣响]

07:12.884 --> 07:15.850
<i>- Okay, Patrick!
It's go time.</i>
<i>- 好吧，帕特里克！
出发时间到了。</i>

07:15.919 --> 07:18.988
- Are we changing our seats?
- Yeah.
- 我们要换座位吗？
- 是的。

07:19.057 --> 07:21.643
I got you the best seat
in the house.
我给你安排了最好的座位
在房子里。

07:21.712 --> 07:24.091
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

07:24.160 --> 07:27.609
Ooh, this is the best seat
in the house.
哦，这是最好的座位
在房子里。

07:27.678 --> 07:29.988
It's like 3D.
就像 3D 一样。

07:30.057 --> 07:33.160
I can almost reach out
and touch the referee.
我几乎可以伸手
并触摸裁判。

07:33.229 --> 07:35.367
- Hey!
- Duh-ow, ho, ho!
- 嘿！
- 嗬嗬，嗬，嗬！

07:35.436 --> 07:40.747
Our next victim... er,
challenger, is...
我们的下一个受害者...呃，
挑战者，是……

07:40.815 --> 07:42.747
Patrick Star!
帕特里克星！

07:42.815 --> 07:44.160
[laughs]
[笑]

07:44.229 --> 07:46.953
The next victim
has the same name as me.
下一个受害者
和我同名。

07:47.022 --> 07:50.436
Yeah, crazy right?
是啊，疯狂吧？

07:50.505 --> 07:52.643
[bell dings]
[铃声]

07:52.712 --> 07:54.988
Oh...
哦...

07:55.057 --> 07:56.850
[screams] No, no,
no, no, no, no, no, no!
[尖叫]不，不，
不，不，不，不，不，不！

07:56.919 --> 07:58.540
Well, it looks like
the challenger
嗯，看起来像
挑战者

07:58.609 --> 08:01.609
is doing a good job
of fighting with himself.
做得很好
与自己战斗。

08:01.678 --> 08:04.264
- No, no, no, no, no, no, no!
- Hm?
- 不，不，不，不，不，不，不！
- 嗯？

08:04.333 --> 08:05.953
Huh?
啊？

08:06.850 --> 08:09.126
[screams]
[grunts]
[尖叫声]
[咕哝]

08:09.195 --> 08:12.022
Patricks:
Tweet, tweet, tweet, tweet.
帕特里克斯：
推文，推文，推文，推文。

08:12.091 --> 08:13.505
[cackles]
[咯咯笑]

08:13.574 --> 08:16.884
No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no!
不，不，不，不，不，不，不，不！

08:16.953 --> 08:19.678
[mumbling]
[咕哝]

08:20.609 --> 08:23.091
[growls]
Yah!
[咆哮]
啊！

08:24.436 --> 08:26.747
[screaming]
[尖叫]

08:26.815 --> 08:28.747
[shouts]
No, no, no, no, no!
[喊叫]
不，不，不，不，不！

08:28.815 --> 08:32.160
[both babbling]
[两人都胡言乱语]

08:32.229 --> 08:34.609
No, no, no!
- [shrieks]
不，不，不！
- [尖叫]

08:34.678 --> 08:36.609
No, no, no, no!
不，不，不，不！

08:37.850 --> 08:39.367
[chomps]
[咀嚼]

08:39.436 --> 08:41.919
No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no!
- [grunts]
不，不，不，不，不，不，不，不！
- [咕哝]

08:43.953 --> 08:47.298
- No, no, no...
- Whew, there we are.
- 不，不，不……
- 哇，我们到了。

08:47.367 --> 08:48.850
Whew.
呼。

08:48.919 --> 08:51.022
Well, folks, I think
it looks like the fight's over.
好吧，伙计们，我想
看来战斗已经结束了。

08:51.091 --> 08:54.850
- What happened?
- I just became rich.
- 发生了什么？
- 我刚刚变得富有。

08:54.919 --> 08:56.988
[bell dings]
- Ooh...
[铃声]
- 哦...

08:57.057 --> 08:58.988
Uh-oh. <i>- No, no, no, no, no, no, no!</i>
呃哦。 <i>- 不，不，不，不，不，不，不！</i>

08:59.057 --> 09:02.160
Whoa!
[grunts]
哇！
[咕哝]

09:02.229 --> 09:04.712
[wheezing]
For my buddy, Patrick.
[喘息]
为了我的朋友帕特里克。

09:04.781 --> 09:07.022
[groans]
I did it, pal.
[呻吟]
我做到了，朋友。

09:07.091 --> 09:09.195
I silenced every bell in town
我让镇上的每一个钟声都安静了

09:09.264 --> 09:12.195
so that you will no longer
have a tantrum,
让你不再
发脾气，

09:12.264 --> 09:13.850
buddy.
伙伴。

09:13.919 --> 09:16.953
Aw, thank you, best friend.
噢，谢谢你，最好的朋友。

09:17.022 --> 09:18.505
Aww.
哇。

09:18.574 --> 09:21.126
I don't care about bells ringing
我不在乎铃声的响起

09:21.195 --> 09:23.471
or conditioning
customers anymore...
或调理
顾客不再...

09:23.540 --> 09:26.436
♪ 'Cause I got
a million dollars ♪
♪ 因为我得到了
一百万美元♪

09:26.505 --> 09:29.160
[chuckles]
[笑声]

09:29.229 --> 09:30.540
[slow-motion cash register ding]
【慢动作收银叮】

09:30.609 --> 09:32.953
[slow-motion] Uh-oh!
[慢动作] 呃哦！

09:33.022 --> 09:34.643
[grunts]
[咕哝]

09:34.712 --> 09:37.505
Oh, no, no, no,
no, no, no, no, no!
哦，不，不，不，
不，不，不，不，不！

09:37.574 --> 09:40.505
No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no!
不，不，不，不，不，不，不，不！

09:40.574 --> 09:42.471
No!
No, no, no, no, no, no, no!
不！
不，不，不，不，不，不，不！

09:42.540 --> 09:44.367
[both grunt]
[两人咕哝]

09:44.436 --> 09:47.022
No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no!
不，不，不，不，不，不，不，不！

09:47.091 --> 09:49.402
No, no, no, no!
No, no, no, no!
不，不，不，不！
不，不，不，不！

09:49.471 --> 09:52.126
No, no, no, no,
no, no, no! [whimpers]
不，不，不，不，
不，不，不！ [呜咽]

09:52.195 --> 09:56.057
Hello, son.
We saw you fighting today...
你好，儿子。
今天我们看到你们打架了...

09:56.126 --> 09:58.988
On the TV.
We're so proud.
在电视上。
我们非常自豪。

09:59.057 --> 10:01.022
Oh, hi, Mr. and Mrs. Star.
噢，嗨，斯塔先生和斯塔太太。

10:01.091 --> 10:02.574
I know you were loving parents,
我知道你们是慈爱的父母，

10:02.643 --> 10:05.057
but you really messed up
your kid by ringing a bell
但你真的搞砸了
你的孩子按响铃

10:05.126 --> 10:07.022
whenever it was time
for his bath.
每当时间到的时候
为他洗澡。

10:07.091 --> 10:09.884
Bell?
We never rang a bell.
钟？
我们从来没有按过门铃。

10:09.953 --> 10:11.815
Yeah.
Never.
是的。
绝不。

10:11.884 --> 10:13.333
[grunts]
[咕哝]

10:13.402 --> 10:16.195
You never rang a bell?
你从来没有按过门铃吗？

10:16.264 --> 10:18.471
[laughing] No.
Don't you remember?
[笑]不。
你不记得了吗？

10:18.540 --> 10:20.229
We would squeeze
your rubber duck.
我们会挤
你的橡皮鸭。

10:20.298 --> 10:24.781
[gasps]
My rubber duck?
[喘气]
我的橡皮鸭？

10:24.850 --> 10:27.815
- Yes, this one.
- [cooing]
- 是的，就是这个。
- [咕咕声]

10:27.884 --> 10:30.988
Aw, kind of gets you
right in your heart's kitchen,
噢，有点明白你的意思
就在你心中的厨房，

10:31.057 --> 10:32.574
doesn't it, Mr. Krabs?
不是吗，蟹老板？

10:32.643 --> 10:35.609
Well, I think I can tape it
all back together.
嗯，我想我可以把它录下来
全部回到一起。

10:35.678 --> 10:39.678
Ducky.
I wonder if it still quacks.
鸭子。
我想知道它是否还在嘎嘎叫。

10:39.747 --> 10:42.195
[quacks]
[庸医]

10:42.264 --> 10:44.815
Whoa, whib, whib, whib, whib!
哇，呜呜，呜呜，呜呜，呜呜！

10:44.884 --> 10:47.471
Whib, whib, whib, whib, whib!
- Oh, here we go again!
呜呜，呜呜，呜呜，呜呜，呜呜！
- 哦，我们又来了！

10:47.540 --> 10:49.367
[laughs]
[笑]

10:49.436 --> 10:52.815
<i>[monkey screeching]</i>
<i>[猴子尖叫]</i>

<i>[猴子尖叫]</i>